<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>YUAA Call for Applications</title>
		<style>

			body {
			     font-family: "Verdana", Arial, sans-serif;
			     margin: 0;
			     padding: 0;
			     background-color: #f4f4f9;
			     color: #333;
			     position: relative;
			     min-height: 100vh;
			 }

			 .main-container {
			     max-width: 1200px;
			     margin: 20px auto;
			     background: white;
			     padding: 20px;
			     border-radius: 5px;
			     box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
			 }

			 .title-block {
			     display: flex;
                 flex-direction: row;
			     align-items: center;
			     background-color: #00356b;
			     color: white;
			     padding: 20px;
			     border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
			     margin-bottom: 20px;
			 }

			 .title-block img {
			     max-height: 100px;
			     max-width: 255px;
			     height: auto;
			 }

			 .title-block .separator {
			     width: 2px;
			     height: 120px;
			     background-color: white;
			     margin: 0 15px;
			 }

			 .title-block h1 {
			     margin: 0;
			     font-size: 30px;
			     font-weight: bold;
			     letter-spacing: 1px;
			     line-height: 1.2;
			 }

			 h2 {
			     font-size: 20px;
			     color: black;
			     margin-top: 15px;
			     margin-bottom: 10px;
			 }

			 body, p, ul, li {
			     white-space: normal; /* Prevents extra spaces from rendering */
			 }

			 p {
			     display: inline; /* Prevents line breaks from adding spacing */
			     font-size: 16px;
			     line-height: 1.6;
                 margin-bottom: 10px;
			     text-indent: 0; /* Prevents the first line from being indented */
			     white-space: normal; /* Prevents extra spaces from rendering */
			 }

			 li {
			     font-size: 16px;
			     line-height: 1.6;
			 }

			 ul {
			     margin: 10px 0 20px;
			     padding-left: 20px;

			 }

			 .highlighted-section {
			     text-align: center;
			     font-size: 18px;
			     font-weight: bold;
			     background-color: #00356b;
			     color: white;
			     padding: 10px;
			     margin-bottom: 20px;
			     border-radius: 5px;
			 }

			 .content-block {
			     margin-bottom: 20px;
			     padding: 15px;
			     border: 1px solid #ddd;
			     border-radius: 5px;
			     white-space: normal;
			 }

			 .sign-off {
					 text-align: left;
					 font-size: 16px;
					 margin-top: 30px;
					 }

				 .sign-off-row {
					 display: flex;
					 align-items: center;      /* centers logo relative to BOTH lines */
					 gap: 10px;
					 }

				 .sign-off-logo {
					 width: 64px;
					 height: 64px;
					 object-fit: contain;
					 flex: 0 0 32px;           /* keeps it square, no shrinking */
					 }

				.sign-off-text {
					 line-height: 1.4;
				 }

			 @media (max-width: 768px) {
			     .title-block {
			         flex-direction: column;
			         align-items: center;
			     }

			     .title-block .separator {
			         display: none;
			     }

			     table {
			         display: block;
			         width: 100%;
			     }

			     table tr {
			         display: block;
			         width: 100%;
			     }

			     table td {
			         display: block;
			         width: 100%;
			         padding: 0;
			         border: none;
			     }

			     .highlighted-section {
			         font-size: 16px;
			         padding: 10px;
			     }

			     .content-block {
			         margin-bottom: 5px;
			         padding: 5px;
			     }

			     img {
			         max-width: 100%;
			         height: auto;
			     }
			 
		</style>
	</head>

	<body>
		<div class="main-container">
			<!-- TITLE BLOCK -->
			<div class="title-block">
                <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
                  <tr>
                    <!-- Image cell -->
                    <td align="left" valign="middle" style="width:242px;">
                        <img
                          src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/YUAA-2010/MissionReport/refs/heads/main/Template/yuaa_white.png"
                          alt="YUAA Logo"
                          style="display: block;"
                        />
                      </td>
                      <!-- Separator cell -->
                      <td align="center" valign="middle" style="padding: 0 15px;">
                        <div style="width: 2px; height: 120px; background-color: white;"></div>
                      </td>
                      <!-- Text cell: left aligned with the separator -->
                      <td align="left" valign="middle">
                        <h1 style="margin: 0;">Spring Board Applications</h1>
                      </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </div>

			<!-- OPENING BLOCK -->
			<div class="content-block">
				<h2> Greetings YUAA,</h2>
				<p>
					We hope you've been having a wonderful holiday season! As we look toward a new semester (and a new workspace), we're seeking to welcome new members onto the YUAA Executive Board. 
					Serving on the YUAA E-Board gives you hands-on experience with technical leadership that will develop your skills, experiences, and yes...your resume (not to mention the  E-Board spring retreat). This is your chance to 
					have a part in the most electric semester in YUAA history - <i>take the leap</i>!
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- TWO COLUMNS -->
			<table align="center" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
				<tr>
					<!-- LEFT COLUMN -->
					<td width="55%" valign="top" style="padding-right: 10px; border-right: 1px solid #ddd;">
						<div class="highlighted-section">CALL FOR APPLICATIONS</div>
						
						<div class="content-block">
							<h2>Roles Available:</h2>
							
							<ul>
								<li>Director of <b>Outreach</b> 
								<li>Director of <b>Development</b> 
								<li>Director of <b>Public Relations</b> 
								<li>Director of <b>Events</b> 
								<li><b>Project Manager</b>
						</div>

						<div class="content-block">
                            <h2>Links</h2>                  
                            <p>
								&rarr; To read <b>role descriptions</b>, <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HyieatGr5CRNSnn95XaWCQJiGnwF_wTGHHtUWHM6Yvc/">click here</a>.
								<br>
								&rarr; To <b>apply to any role</b>, <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSerYm_u_k2Erx52A7liaUPBC4ooHwVpq-SN7NI9fBAQSrNXuw/viewform?usp=sharing&ouid=113607142644466827806">click here</a>.
							</p>
                         </div>

					</td>

					<!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->
					<td width="45%" valign="top" style="padding-left: 10px;">
						<div class="highlighted-section">Bonus: Room Update!</div>
						<div class="content-block">
							<h2>Lab Safety Training</h2>
							<p> 
								As part of our transition into our new workspace, we will be having a <b>mandatory safety meeting</b> with EHS during the first week of the spring semester (time TBD, but pencil in Monday afternoon at 4:15 for now).
								Furthermore, EHS has requested that anyone who will have swipe access to our new room complete a Lab Safety Training course. 
								This course should show up on your Workday account in the near future; please complete it as soon as you can and <i>shoot us a message</i> once you do for documentation purposes.
							</p>
							<br>
							<img
								src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/YUAA-2010/MissionReport/refs/heads/main/Template/yuaa_black.png"
								alt="YUAA"
								style="max-width: 80%; border-radius: 5px;"
							/>
						</div>
					</td>
				</tr>
			</table>

			<!-- SIGN-OFF (email-safe) -->
			<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:30px;">
			<tr>
				<td style="vertical-align:middle; padding-right:16px;">
					<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/YUAA-2010/MissionReport/refs/heads/main/Template/YUAA%20Logo.png" alt="Logo" width="48" height="48"
						style="display:block; width:81px; height:81px; margin-top:0px;" />
				</td>
				<td style="vertical-align:middle; font-size:16px; line-height:1.4; color:#333; font-family:Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;">
					Ad Astra,<br />
					<b>Ava &amp; Aaron</b>
				</td>
			</tr>
			</table>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>
